  {
   "id": "under-the-waves-214402@1.04",
   "gameId": "under-the-waves-214402",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.04",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-09-25T16:20:03.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello divers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new patch is available now for Under the Waves!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This patch introduces new graphical options and also fixes other bugs:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Gameplay",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "● Fixed Moon still going forward during WWII submarine reveal.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Added respawning oil traces after Day 15 for players being stuck during Depollution quest if they already cleaned all the oil traces.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed synchronization in the guitar mini game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed Stan playing air guitar.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● It’s no longer possible to exit the Life Module before completing all the morning objectives during Day 16.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Stan correctly switches to swim when falling from a platform.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● All Platforms: Stan doesn’t fall through Moon when entering from a platform.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed landslide blocking Stan away from Moon, in Sector C.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed the ending cutscene sometimes not being played.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed a gameover loop when lacking oxygen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed a loot zone near Sector B generating a big white circle marker on the map.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed sticker boxes looking like they're not opened yet.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Environment",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "● The helix collisions have been improved in the tunnels.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Removed a collision in Dispatcher, preventing the player from reaching and interacting with a door.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed an issue where the player could land on the top of the MainDrill Building in sector A without cleaning the oil trace.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Removed a hole in the landscape near Sector C entrance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Probe’s cave entrances have been modified to make them more visible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed collisions on the base of the Life Module.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed floor collision in drone hive.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed collisions on some rocks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Removed some rocks floating on the Dispatcher’s pipes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Removed some foliage floating in the Abyss cave.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Removed some vegetation floating above the surface, near sector A.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed visual glitches that occur sometimes in the Life Module.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Changed displayed screen on the broken antenna.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed flying turbines over the elevator.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed Moon Garage Door staying open.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Music & voices",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "● Fixed generic music being cut in some conditions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● There are more moments to appreciate the silence of the ocean.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed Stan’s dialog when interacting with the mirror, being not coherent with the moment of the day.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● French version only: Fixed the dialog during a call with Emma being cut by another dialog.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Options",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "● Added Graphic Option to attenuate the Grain.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Added Graphic Option to disable the Chromatic Aberration.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Added an option to invert the camera X axis when using the mouse.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "● Added an option to disable the Letterboxing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Added an option to disable the Lens Dirt.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Saves",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "● Now supports saves on the Cloud.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed the save of daily logs that might be not saved sometimes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Misc",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "● Disabled tips in loading screens after Stan’s last choice.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
