   "announcedAt": "2023-09-12T15:14:35.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A new patch is available for Under the Waves! This patch focuses on fixing bugs and issues with achievements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We would like to thank you again for all your support, and for sharing feedback about the game. It really helps us improve the experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are still committed to offering the best possible experience when playing Under the Waves, and the team is currently working on future patches that will offer more graphical setting options. Stay tuned for more on that!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "On to today’s patch notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "● Fixed Trophy01 “Under The Waves” still being locked after completing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed some trophies not being unlocked when completing them in sector maps.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Already completed trophies will be correctly unlocked when loading the saved game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Added Collectible Yellow boot inside the U-Sub WWII (J0 does not give it on day 14 anymore)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed a hole in the landscape.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed a parasite frame before the cinematic after Stan’s choice.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed looted chests still having a marker on map",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed plastic boots not having their basic appearance but always the yellow one.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed proteus rocks being burnt in sectors maps not counting for the quest.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Added an intermediate marker to lead towards the server room in Bunker Office in sector B.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed Stan not able to exit Moon during low integrity warning.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed photo quest not working with sleeping whales.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed “Cleaning Operation” quest that couldn’t be completed from sector areas.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed “Cleaning Operation” quest where the progression for the objective “Clean the Area” was not correctly saved.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed Moon still boosting during the reveal Submarine WWII cinematic if the player arrives in the area while boosting.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed an issue on Elevator Engine going out of the axis.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed a blocker issue where reloading a save after day 14 where the player exits the submarine “WWII” would end up in a black screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed an issue where Moon spawned in a rock when reloading inside the submarine “WWII” after day 14.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed a loot zone marker looking like a big white dot on the map.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed a crash that may happen when visualizing photos taken with the Camera.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed visual glitch happening sometimes in the Life Module.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "● Fixed a bug where the Moon Hangar door would stay open, making a hole to go under the game map.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
